{"id":"6e57c20334785069","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-monosperner.md","title":"Positive functions and Sperner families","display":"thm-monosperner — Positive functions and Sperner families","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-monosperner","aliases":["27-thm-monosperner"],"display":"thm-monosperner — Positive functions and Sperner families","depends_on":["[[27-df-monotone]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-sperner]]","[[27-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-monosperner"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-monosperner</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-monosperner — Positive functions and Sperner families"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"29802849e85128b9\" href=\"?note=29802849e85128b9\" title=\"27-df-sperner\">27-df-sperner</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sperner}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sperner}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"29802849e85128b9\" href=\"?note=29802849e85128b9\" title=\"27-df-sperner\">27-df-sperner</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}}\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n),\\qquad\n\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\Phi_n(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\;(\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;(\\Phi_n(f)=\\mathcal F))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}}\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n),\\qquad\n\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\Phi_n(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\;(\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;(\\Phi_n(f)=\\mathcal F))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §1.10.3, discussion and Theorem 1.26; §4.2.1，印刷页 39;177，PDF 第 63;201 页（从 1 计数）。 修正旧版本把变量索引集 A 直接当作文字集 L 的类型混淆。已核对证明：正素项对应极小真点；逆映射取由集合族生成的上闭集之示性函数。空族对应常零，{∅} 对应常一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sperner","status":"resolved","id":"29802849e85128b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sperner]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$, $\\mathrm{PI}$ and $\\mathrm{Sperner}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]], [[27-df-piset]] and [[27-df-sperner]]; $T_L$ is defined in [[27-df-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$, $\\mathrm{PI}$ and $\\mathrm{Sperner}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]], [[27-df-piset]] and [[27-df-sperner]]; $T_L$ is defined in [[27-df-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sperner","status":"resolved","id":"29802849e85128b9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$, $\\mathrm{PI}$ and $\\mathrm{Sperner}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]], [[27-df-piset]] and [[27-df-sperner]]; $T_L$ is defined in [[27-df-term]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$, $\\mathrm{PI}$ and $\\mathrm{Sperner}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]], [[27-df-piset]] and [[27-df-sperner]]; $T_L$ is defined in [[27-df-term]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sperner}","display":false},{"tex":"T_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq[n]:T_{\\{x_i:i\\in A\\}}\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n),\\qquad\n\\left(\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\Phi_n(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\;(\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\;(\\Phi_n(f)=\\mathcal F))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-475","locations":["正文